  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience for this meme is individuals who are familiar with and may find humor in racially charged stereotypes, particularly those that dehumanize Black people by comparing them to primates. The meme relies on the audience's recognition of the harmful anti-Black trope of 'pissed primate' to generate its intended comedic effect, suggesting the audience is aware of this stereotype and finds it amusing, despite its offensive nature. The meme is designed to resonate with users who either perpetuate or are indifferent to such racist imagery, often found in online communities that normalize or circulate such content.",
